156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (Existing studies on the Adult dataset generally fall into two categories: performance benchmarking and fairness-aware modeling. Benchmarking studies often prioritize predictive accuracy but do not systematically explore hyperparameter optimization, multi-metric evaluation, or robustness through stratified cross-validation. Conversely, fairness-oriented studies focus on bias mitigation without emphasizing performance optimization or model tuning.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [30]
>>
endobj
157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (There is limited research integrating predictive optimization and fairness evaluation within a single end-to-end machine learning framework. This project addresses this gap by combining systematic hyperparameter tuning, comprehensive evaluation metrics, and fairness assessment.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [31]
>>
endobj
